.TH CBSTMAP_ELEM_COUNT 3 "2026-07-10" "c_collections" "C Collections Library - Functions"
.SH NAME
cbstmap_size \- get the number of elements in the map
.SH LIBRARY
C Collections (libccollections, \-lccollections)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include <ccollections/cbstmap.h>

size_t cbstmap_size(cbmap cbm);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.nf
Returns how many key-value pairs the BST map stores right now.
.fi
.SH PARAMETERS
.nf
cbm  BST map to query
.fi
.SH RETURN VALUE
.nf
The number of elements in the map.
.fi
.SH NOTES
.nf
O(1). The function asserts if cbm is NULL.
.fi
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR cbstmap_insert_elem (3),
.BR cbstmap_remove_elem (3)
